WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:02.977
You nicknamed me, many years
ago you came on the show

00:00:02.977 --> 00:00:06.044
and we were talking about nicknames

00:00:06.044 --> 00:00:07.545
and I said, what would my nickname be

00:00:07.545 --> 00:00:09.093
and you said, "Coner Boner".

00:00:09.093 --> 00:00:12.093
(audience laughing)

00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:13.398
I have a new one for you now.

00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:14.642
Oh, you have a new one?

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:16.712
Okay, 'cause I thought that was fantastic.

00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:17.545
I know.

00:00:17.545 --> 00:00:18.459
What's the new one?

00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:19.380
I think you need an upgrade.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.360
Yes, thank you.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.029
So, in light of this movie

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:25.615
and the Statesman,
Statesman wanna offer you

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:27.033
a new nickname.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.881
I will take any nickname,
I've been Coco for a while

00:00:29.881 --> 00:00:30.714
and it's done nothing for me.

00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:32.130
Okay.
So I'm ready

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.054
to move on, yeah.

00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:35.873
This one might help you a little bit,

00:00:35.873 --> 00:00:36.706
it's Aperol ...

00:00:36.706 --> 00:00:37.692
[Man In Audience] I love you.

00:00:37.692 --> 00:00:38.833
(audience laughing)

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:39.666
Thank you.

00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:42.269
Wow, he chose his moment perfectly.

00:00:42.269 --> 00:00:45.062
(audience laughing)

00:00:45.062 --> 00:00:47.479
It's about to be about you.

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:52.316
He was in line thinking,
"If I get in there."

00:00:53.258 --> 00:00:54.520
When Halle Berry starts to talk,

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.931
I'm gonna wait until she starts saying

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:59.387
something real important
to tell her I love her.

00:00:59.387 --> 00:01:01.913
And the Darth Vader helmet
goes right back on again.

00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:03.977
(audience laughing)

00:01:03.977 --> 00:01:06.227
I want to hear my nickname.

00:01:08.191 --> 00:01:10.376
I'll take care of you,
don't worry, you're mine.

00:01:10.376 --> 00:01:11.209
Grrr!

00:01:11.209 --> 00:01:12.042
Agrrr!

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:15.856
Okay, so your new name is Aperol Spritz.

00:01:15.856 --> 00:01:16.923
What, Aperol?

00:01:16.923 --> 00:01:17.801
What's that?

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:20.112
Well, I brought a picture of it.

00:01:20.112 --> 00:01:21.888
[Conan] I don't know
what an Aperol Spritz is.

00:01:21.888 --> 00:01:23.015
That's an Aperol Spritz.

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:25.007
(laughing)

00:01:25.007 --> 00:01:28.056
[Channing] Can I offer another option?

00:01:28.056 --> 00:01:29.916
But wait, but wait, it's like that.

00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:31.423
Your hair used to be much redder.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:32.940
It used to be much redder,
yeah, I'm getting old.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:33.987
That's why I came up with that.

00:01:33.987 --> 00:01:35.331
Yeah, okay, Aperol Spritz.

00:01:35.331 --> 00:01:36.236
Aperol Spritz ...
Yeah, you know what?

00:01:36.236 --> 00:01:39.213
Dudes really fear when
Aperol Spritz comes to town.

00:01:39.213 --> 00:01:40.251
(audience laughing)

00:01:40.251 --> 00:01:41.368
Channing, you had another idea?

00:01:41.368 --> 00:01:42.765
Just another option, Fireball.

00:01:42.765 --> 00:01:43.598
[Man In Audience] We love you!

00:01:43.598 --> 00:01:44.431
[Conan] What's that?

00:01:44.431 --> 00:01:45.348
Fireball.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:48.363
No, no, no.

00:01:48.363 --> 00:01:49.214
And helmet back on.

00:01:49.214 --> 00:01:51.214
I can't hear anything.

